Description: Provides a lightweight set of Seurat-like helpers for
    single-cell analysis based on the Bioconductor SingleCellExperiment
    class. Includes preprocessing, dimensionality reduction, clustering,
    visualization, batch correction, and pseudobulk differential
    expression, plus interoperability with AnnData. Optional wrappers
    integrate popular downstream tools for trajectory inference,
    enrichment analysis, cell type annotation, cell-cell communication,
    and differential abundance.
